   "subject": "Re: Is file uploaded by fileInput stored in memory or disk?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">the file is stored in a temp folder. the path is stored in<br><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:18px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\"></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">inFile</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">datapath</span><span></span></code></pre>the data frame for this file is stored in memory as passed to the renderTable function. if you want a way to access this data frame, you can do this<br><br><code></code><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:18px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\"></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span>myDataFrame <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">reactive</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span></code></pre></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:18px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\">\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">inFile</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">file1</span>\r\n\r\n    <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">if</span></span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">is.null</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">inFile</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n      <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">return</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(88,72,246)\">NULL</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n    \r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">read.csv</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">inFile</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">datapath</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">header</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">header</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">sep</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">sep</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">quote</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">quote</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n  <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span></code></pre></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:18px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"></code></pre> then call myDataFrame() whenever you want the data</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Sunday, October 18, 2015 at 10:46:51 PM UTC-4, Sijie Chen wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I am trying to build a shiny application which accepts each user&#39;s data and provides the analysis result for each user. Users must upload files to deliver their data.<div>I use the following code to upload files.</div><div>ui.R</div><div><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:18px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-radius:4px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinyUI</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">pageWithSidebar</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">headerPanel</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;CSV Viewer&quot;</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">sidebarPanel</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span>\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fileInput</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;file1&#39;</span></span><span>,</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;Choose CSV File&#39;</span></span><span>,</span>\r\n              <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">accept</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;text/csv&#39;</span></span><span>,</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;text/comma-separated-values,text/plain&#39;</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,</span>\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">tags</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">hr</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,</span>\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">checkboxInput</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;header&#39;</span></span><span>,</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;Header&#39;</span></span><span>,</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(88,72,246)\">TRUE</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,</span>\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">radioButtons</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;sep&#39;</span></span><span>,</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;Separator&#39;</span></span><span>,</span>\r\n                 <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Comma</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;,&#39;</span></span><span>,</span>\r\n                   <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Semicolon</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&#39;;&#39;</span></span><span>,</span>\r\n                   <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Tab</span><span><span style=